	(text_box "EN/SYNC pin: Open-drain, internal 500 kOhm pull-down.\nPG1V2 with 47 kOhm pull-up to 1V2 rail (instead of 5V) to perform a sequential power-up (first 1V2, second 3V3, see note below)"
